  "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
  "text": "At SparkFest, children bring stories and things they have made. Some arrive finished; some still have a part their maker is working out. Today we’re opening The Garden Adventure.\n\nWelcome back. Loop has the pictures of your adventure ready. You can watch the whole ending or tell it aloud as the pictures change. This is the visit you and Pip made together.\n\nPip has promised to plant a seed with Grandma. Guide him there, read what he finds, and choose how he responds to the people he meets.\n\nThis is Loop, our rolling projector. When Loop shines the pictures onto the screen, you can step into Pip’s paper world.\n\nJo",
  "textSha256": "297c944a975be34afc83c784675ddc78bc51484d3dd2466795bc609e7399d1e1",
